From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: perfectra1n <jonfuller2012@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 12:16:40 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] feat(act): run jobs on a backend plugin environment

A job whose runs-on is picked by Config.BackendPicker starts on the
configured plugin instead of the host or Docker: the job image, services
and label argument go to the plugin, event.json and envs.txt are copied
in, and RUNNER_* come from the layout the plugin reports. docker:// and
Dockerfile actions fail with a clear error, as there is no daemon.

